{"content_hash": "e248effc80a1bc11", "version_id": 983, "article_id": 99, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "12.5 million Americans plan to skip work for GTA 6", "title_zh": "1250万美国人打算为《GTA6》请假", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ithome", "source_url": "https://www.ithome.com/1/027/486.htm", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1717501216174-9dc275fe680d?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8bWFnfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ3OTE3ODd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Doriana Popa on Unsplash", "author": "Doriana Popa", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@ibreathart?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-table-topped-with-a-cake-and-flowers-XtPq1tkY7sA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(82, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(120, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "7ee29fdf7be5"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-16", "word_count": 215, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "A new survey says millions of US players want free time on November 19, the day GTA 6 comes out. Many will take paid leave or change their work and school hours.", "lead_zh": "一项新调查显示，数百万美国玩家想在11月19日《GTA6》发售当天腾出时间。不少人会请带薪假，或者调整上班和上学时间。", "preview": "Tech site PC Mag published the report, which looks at how far players will go for the open-world game. About 8% of adult gamers in the US pl", "preview_zh": "科技网站 PC Mag 发布了这份报告，关注玩家为了这款开放世界游戏愿意做到什么程度。约8%的美国成年玩家打算当天请带薪假或调整日程，算下来大约有1250万人。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 964, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 81.525, "size_bytes": 490176, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 248, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 82.95, "size_bytes": 498672, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 248, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 89.7, "size_bytes": 539136, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 248, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 77.0, "size_bytes": 462960, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 248, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/99/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 83.6, "size_bytes": 502560, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 248, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/99/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@62070c4b/content/data/versions/983.json", "paragraphs": ["Tech site PC Mag published the report, which looks at how far players will go for the open-world game. About 8% of adult gamers in the US plan to take paid leave or move their schedule that day. That works out to roughly 12.5 million people.", "Younger players are the most willing to change their plans, because 13% of Gen Z gamers said they would rearrange their week. Although the game only runs on current consoles, 7% of players plan to upgrade their hardware for it or for other big releases.", "However, not everyone is rushing to play on day one. About 68% of the people asked said they have no plans to start the game at launch. Of the rest, 14% will use normal free time, while 4% will set aside evenings and weekends.", "Some players want more than a single day. About 3% plan to take two days off or longer, and another 3% will take one full day. A further 2% will take half a day or simply change their working hours.", "PC Mag asked YouGov Plc to run the survey, which covered 2,024 adults, including 1,154 gamers. The online poll ran from October 23 to 27, 2026, and the data was weighted to represent all US adults aged 18 and over."], "paragraphs_zh": ["科技网站 PC Mag 发布了这份报告，关注玩家为了这款开放世界游戏愿意做到什么程度。约8%的美国成年玩家打算当天请带薪假或调整日程，算下来大约有1250万人。", "年轻玩家最愿意改变计划，因为13%的Z世代玩家表示会重新安排这一周。虽然这款游戏只在现世代主机上运行，仍有7%的玩家打算为它或其他重磅新作升级设备。", "不过，并不是所有人都急着在发售第一天就玩。约68%的受访者表示没打算在首发时开玩。其余的人里，14%会用平时的空闲时间，4%会专门留出晚上和周末。", "有些玩家想要的不止一天。约3%计划请两天或更长的假，另有3%会请整整一天，还有2%会请半天假或干脆调整工作时间。", "PC Mag 委托 YouGov Plc 开展调查，共覆盖2024名成年人，其中1154人是玩家。这次线上调查于2026年10月23日至27日进行，数据经过加权，可代表全美18岁及以上成年人。"], "body": "Tech site PC Mag published the report, which looks at how far players will go for the open-world game. About 8% of adult gamers in the US plan to take paid leave or move their schedule that day. That works out to roughly 12.5 million people.\n\nYounger players are the most willing to change their plans, because 13% of Gen Z gamers said they would rearrange their week. Although the game only runs on current consoles, 7% of players plan to upgrade their hardware for it or for other big releases.\n\nHowever, not everyone is rushing to play on day one. About 68% of the people asked said they have no plans to start the game at launch. Of the rest, 14% will use normal free time, while 4% will set aside evenings and weekends.\n\nSome players want more than a single day. About 3% plan to take two days off or longer, and another 3% will take one full day. A further 2% will take half a day or simply change their working hours.\n\nPC Mag asked YouGov Plc to run the survey, which covered 2,024 adults, including 1,154 gamers. The online poll ran from October 23 to 27, 2026, and the data was weighted to represent all US adults aged 18 and over.", "body_zh": "科技网站 PC Mag 发布了这份报告，关注玩家为了这款开放世界游戏愿意做到什么程度。约8%的美国成年玩家打算当天请带薪假或调整日程，算下来大约有1250万人。\n\n年轻玩家最愿意改变计划，因为13%的Z世代玩家表示会重新安排这一周。虽然这款游戏只在现世代主机上运行，仍有7%的玩家打算为它或其他重磅新作升级设备。\n\n不过，并不是所有人都急着在发售第一天就玩。约68%的受访者表示没打算在首发时开玩。其余的人里，14%会用平时的空闲时间，4%会专门留出晚上和周末。\n\n有些玩家想要的不止一天。约3%计划请两天或更长的假，另有3%会请整整一天，还有2%会请半天假或干脆调整工作时间。\n\nPC Mag 委托 YouGov Plc 开展调查，共覆盖2024名成年人，其中1154人是玩家。这次线上调查于2026年10月23日至27日进行，数据经过加权，可代表全美18岁及以上成年人。", "text": "Tech site PC Mag published the report, which looks at how far players will go for the open-world game. About 8% of adult gamers in the US plan to take paid leave or move their schedule that day. That works out to roughly 12.5 million people. Younger players are the most willing to change their plans, because 13% of Gen Z gamers said they would rearrange their week. Although the game only runs on current consoles, 7% of players plan to upgrade their hardware for it or for other big releases. However, not everyone is rushing to play on day one. About 68% of the people asked said they have no plans to start the game at launch. Of the rest, 14% will use normal free time, while 4% will set aside evenings and weekends. Some players want more than a single day. About 3% plan to take two days off or longer, and another 3% will take one full day. A further 2% will take half a day or simply change their working hours. PC Mag asked YouGov Plc to run the survey, which covered 2,024 adults, including 1,154 gamers. The online poll ran from October 23 to 27, 2026, and the data was weighted to represent all US adults aged 18 and over.", "vocab": [{"word": "survey", "pos": "noun", "zh": "调查", "note": "常与 conduct/run a survey 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "paid leave", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "带薪假", "note": "take paid leave 请带薪假", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "schedule", "pos": "noun", "zh": "日程安排", "note": "change/move your schedule 调整日程", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "work out to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "算下来是